{"id":"0494a2630c9bee7c","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family.md","title":"ZFC Skolem Function Family","display":"df-zfc-skolem-function-family — ZFC Skolem Function Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family"],"display":"df-zfc-skolem-function-family — ZFC Skolem Function Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-skolem-function-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-skolem-function-family — ZFC Skolem Function Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73aeb5eda1445c82\" href=\"?note=73aeb5eda1445c82\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71df01d9acb296bc\" href=\"?note=71df01d9acb296bc\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,L,\\Phi,\\mathcal F,\\varphi,f\\in V\">\\(M,L,\\Phi,\\mathcal F,\\varphi,f\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\)</span>（结构谓词与底集）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S(\\Phi,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S(\\Phi,L)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-公式编码集合，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"73aeb5eda1445c82\" href=\"?note=73aeb5eda1445c82\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\\)</span>（带语言和公式参数的 Skolem 函数编码，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"71df01d9acb296bc\" href=\"?note=71df01d9acb296bc\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-model10-skolem-function-code.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 为公式文件中固定的两两不同变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\\)</span> 为下式定义的有限元组版本。二参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\\)</span> 用于集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 上的成员结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TupleDefaultAssign}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TupleDefaultAssign}_S\\)</span> 为下式定义的偏类函数，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是自然数长度的函数图。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\in\\omega\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{TupleDefaultAssign}_S(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,b\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},a(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle v_{i+1},b\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\operatorname{dom}(a),\\operatorname{ran}(a))\\land\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\in\\omega\\ \\to\\\n\\mathrm{TupleDefaultAssign}_S(a,b)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,b\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},a(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle v_{i+1},b\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(g,M,\\varphi,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\nf(a)=g\\left(\\{\\langle v_0,b\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},a(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle v_{i+1},b\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\;\\exists g\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10SkolemFunctionCode}_S(g,M,\\varphi,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\nf(a)=g\\left(\\{\\langle v_0,b\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},a(i)\\rangle:i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle v_{i+1},b\\rangle:i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}(a)\\}\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,M,L,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S(\\Phi,L)\n\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,M,L,\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(M,L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel9FormulaCodeSet}_S(\\Phi,L)\n\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{\\mathrm{Univ}(M)^{&lt;\\omega}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathrm{SkolemTupleFunctionCode}_S(f,M,\\varphi,L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Phi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S\\left(\\mathcal F,\n\\langle U,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U^2:x\\in y\\}\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Phi\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S(\\mathcal F,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Phi\\in V\\;\\mathrm{SkolemFunctionFamily}_S\\left(\\mathcal F,\n\\langle U,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in U^2:x\\in y\\}\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Phi\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第一方向保证每个公式编码都有见证选择函数；第二方向排除与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 无关的函数。</li>\n<li>公式量词必须限制在集合编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 中，否则“所有公式对应的函数族”不能直接视为 ZFC 集合。</li>\n<li>Skolem 闭包是对给定函数族闭包一个集合的后续构造，不是函数族定义本身。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"73aeb5eda1445c82","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-model9-formula-code-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58